<title>USA: NBA BASKETBALL-TUESDAY'S PLAYOFF RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NBA BASKETBALL-TUESDAY'S PLAYOFF RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of first-round NBA</p>
<p>playoff games on Tuesday (home team in CAPS):</p>
<p>		  EASTERN CONFERENCE</p>
<p> ORLANDO	     88  Miami	     75</p>
<p>(Miami leads best-of-five series 2-1)</p>
<p> Detroit	     99  ATLANTA	   91</p>
<p>(Detroit leads best-of-five series 2-1)</p>
<p>		 WESTERN CONFERENCE</p>
<p> PHOENIX	    110  Seattle	   103</p>
<p>(Phoenix leads best-of-five series 2-1)</p>
<p> Houston	    125  MINNESOTA	 120</p>
<p>(Houston wins best-of-five series 3-0)</p>
</text>
